@@ -9084,3 +9084,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A1 — Headroom gate + executable-oracle corpus census. Build reusable scripts/headroom_gate.py: for each cached candidate pool compute oracle@k vs baseline pass@1 vs SC-vote with an OBJECTIVE/EXECUTABLE oracle (run code/tests, parse math — NO LLM judge, per arXiv:2605.07395), and flag artifact inflation (truncation/format mismatch). Census {{code HumanEval/MBPP (exp1999/2090/1607), math GSM8K, Sudoku held-out}}. Emit max_selectable_headroom (BARE) + headroom_present_domain. This is the POSITIVE CONTROL the moat test requires. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: headroom_present_domain_code_max_selectable_headroom_0.1800; results/experiment_4175_headroom_gate_executable_census.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A2 — V-STaR learned selector (arXiv:2402.06457). Train an oracle-free selector on ACCEPTED + REJECTED candidate traces (so it learns a correctness boundary, not just imitates winners), out-of-fold. The missing learned-selector verifier class. Deployable ranker consumed by A3. Prefer cached traces; if fresh traces needed, generate from a SOTA GGUF behind a PRECONDITIONS cache check. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: vstar_selector_trained_delta_0.1800_auroc_0.9792; results/experiment_4176_vstar_learned_selector.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A3 (DECISIVE, gated_on A1 headroom>=0.10) — the headroom-controlled verifier moat test. On the headroom_present_domain: executable verifier ensemble + V-STaR selector (A2) vs SC-vote vs oracle, with a MATCHED no-verifier control (same budget/candidates/steps, arXiv:2511.02886) and accuracy AND cost (arXiv:2504.01005 SC-crossover). Decisive: does the verifier add value (CI95 excl 0) WHERE headroom exists? Resolves the moat question + informs the DiffusionGemma gate. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: verifier_value_added_true_delta_0.1800_ci95_0.0800_0.3000; results/experiment_4177_decisive_headroom_controlled_moat_test.json
+- 2026-06-14: PHASE B — GAP-3 Stage-1 model-native ARC energy (CPU; the activation dump ALREADY EXISTS). On results/arc3_gap3_stage1_candidate_table.npz (z_mean (8041,512), votes, q_mean, probe, correct, task_idx): score with (1a) a model-native ORTHOGONAL basis (arXiv:2604.17614) + (1b) the learned OOF probe. Run ALL gates (selection>vote, AUROC>0.70, coverage>=80%, headroom-capture>=30%) + ALL adversarial checks (permutation, strict OOF, oracle-leak, bootstrap CI). Does it reach the proven ~13pp ARC headroom? READ-ONLY w.r.t. TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: gap3_stage1_model_native_latent_honest_negative_model_native_basis_pca_gold_mahalanobis_delta_0.0000_energy_0.4516_vote_0.4516; results/experiment_4178_gap3_stage1_model_native_arc_energy.json
